sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User Interface
  participant H as Host Process
  participant S as Scheduler (tsr-infer)
  participant V as Supervisor
  participant W as llama-server (Job Object)

  U->>H: Request (Ask / Draft)
  H->>S: Enqueue job at priority P0
  alt Worker not running
    S->>V: Ensure worker ready
    V->>W: CreateProcess (CREATE_SUSPENDED, cleared environment)
    V->>W: Assign to Job Object, then resume
    V->>W: GET /health until ready
    W-->>V: HTTP 200
    V->>V: Verify listening port owner PID
  end
  opt A P1 job is already streaming
    S->>W: Close the P1 HTTP stream
    S->>S: Re-queue the P1 job in its old place
  end
  S->>W: POST /v1/chat/completions (grammar constrained)
  W-->>S: Streamed tokens
  S->>H: Parsed output
  H->>H: Schema check, evidence check, redaction
  H-->>U: Validated result with citations
